MACRO P                                                                         
 &P.DUB-W6115B01                                        1    18 A               
*                                 DOUBLE REC INFO ON KDINLUPF                   
*                                 LEAD TIME DATA FOR INBOUND PER                
*                                 PLACEMENT IN DIFFERENT IDDC                   
*                                 AIM TIMES FOR WORKFLOW                        
     &P.DUB-IDDC                                        1     2 A               
*                                 WAREHOUSE IDENTIFIER                          
     &P.DUB-ADINLOMR                                    3     4 A               
*                                 RECEIVING AREA                                
     &P.DUB-KDINLUPF                                    7     4 A               
*                                 FOLLOW-UP STATUS RECEIVING                    
     &P.DUB-KVTID-NORM                                 11     4 N               
*                                 NORMAL AIM TIME FOR AN ADDRESS                
     &P.DUB-KVTID-PRIO                                 15     4 N               
*                                 PRIO AIM TIME WORKFLOW/ADDRESS                
*** END COPY                             LENGTH =            18                 
